# MkDocs build output
site/

# Graphify local cache/intermediate files; graph.json + GRAPH_REPORT.md are
# intentionally tracked (kept in sync by .githooks/pre-commit) — see
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md "Developer setup". graphify-out/memory/ (save-result)
# and reflections/LESSONS.md (reflect) are also tracked so the query-outcome
# feedback loop persists across sessions/branches — see AGENTS.md "Codebase
# knowledge tools".
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/memory/
!graphify-out/memory/*.md
!graphify-out/reflections/
!graphify-out/reflections/LESSONS.md

# Local dev tool symlinks (see tools/README.md); release CI ships real binaries.
tools/*
!tools/README.md
